LLVM libunwind and compiler-rt 17.0.6, and musl 1.2.5. No zlib/zstd is linked
into this original control. Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, with the legacy
and third-party terms reproduced in LICENSES/llvm/ and musl's terms below.
Source: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/releases/tag/llvmorg-17.0.6
Build recipe: https://github.com/wolffe-lang/pax/blob/3e28a8bc79d7ff879f74c1872fe1bc9ccfa97a1f/notes/px60/build-lld.sh
LLVM Support's regex derives from Henry Spencer's implementation and the
University of California's work; it is the LLVM-adapted version, not their
original software. The unchanged copyright notices and terms are included.
LLVM Support's BLAKE3 is CC0-1.0 OR Apache-2.0; its complete notice is included.

