Use and verification
--------------------

The complete files in LICENSES/ are authoritative; this inventory is not a
replacement for their terms. The source trees and build recipes above are
available without charge. Redistribution must preserve this notice, the
licence files, and clear access to corresponding source alongside binaries.

After verifying the archive's published SHA-256 and extracting it into a new
directory, run `sha256sum -c MANIFEST` there. The eight binary paths retain
the existing bundle interface. cc uses PAX_LLD and PAX_CC_SYSROOT; ligature
uses LIGATURE_SYSROOT. Set WOLF_RT_LIB to this bundle's libwolf_rt.a when
compiling with wolf 0.2.36. Nothing here changes your system toolchain.
